  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centre pour la Gouvernance D&#xe9;mocratique 2013-2018 - CGD 2013-2018</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Centre pour la Gouvernance D&#xe9;mocratique 2013-2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att 1) H&#xf6;ja effektiviteten hos de demokratiska och republikanska institutionerna, n&#xe4;mligen parlamentet, valmyndigheten (CENI), s&#xe4;kerhetsstyrkorna, r&#xe4;ttsv&#xe4;sendet, kommunfullm&#xe4;ktige och de politiska partierna f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka den demokratiska processen i Burkina Faso. 2) H&#xf6;ja medvetenheten om den r&#xe4;ttsliga inneb&#xf6;rden av medborgarskap genom utbildning och tr&#xe4;ning vad g&#xe4;ller styrelses&#xe4;tt 3) &#xd6;ka medborgarnas inflytande p&#xe5; den offentliga politiken samt 4) st&#xe4;rka CGD i att utf&#xf6;ra sina uppgifter, att p&#xe5;verka fr&#xe5;gor om demokratiskt styre. CGD kommer att implementera programmet tillsammans med sina partners. Programmets totala budget uppg&#xe5;r till 15,7 MSEK av vilken CGD:s egna finansiering utg&#xf6;r ca 54 200 SEK. Resterande del finansieras genom givare, varav Sida bidrar med 2,5 MSEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden  will  support for two years  CGD&apos;s  action  plan  2015-2017  with  a  contribution  amounting  to  2,5  MSEK  that  will be  coordinated  and  followed  up  with  the  other  co-financing  donor  (Denmark).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the contribution was to contribute to the promotion of democracy in Burkina Faso through the creation of knowledge and space for questioning&#xa0;the actors of democratic governance.
The programme had four axis of intervention:
Axis 1. Strengthening the institutional landscape
Main objective&#xa0;: Contribute to strengthening the credibility of state institutions to consolidate the democratic process in Burkina Faso.
Specific objective: Increase the effectiveness of state institutions through the diagnostic analysis of their functioning, the formulation of relevant proposals and support for the implementation of the recommendations.
Axis 2. Promotion of a civic culture in Burkina Faso
Main objective: Contribute to the promotion of citizenship through information and training of governance actors.
Specific objectives: Increase the influence of actors and citizens on public policies.
Axis 3. Follow-up learning and dissemination of experiences
Main objective: Contribute to the consolidation of democratic governance through better sharing of research results and experiences
Specific objective: Increase the impact of CGD actions on democratic governance&#xa0;
Axis 4. Capacity building of the CGD
Main objective: Contribute to improving the institutional and technical capacities of the CGD to promote democratic governance.
Specific objective: Strengthen the capacity of the CGD to assume its missions of influence on the issues of democratic governance.</narrative>
  </description>
